.SS "template<\fBlength_t\fP L, \fBqualifier\fP Q> \fBGLM_FUNC_DECL\fP \fBvec\fP< \fBL\fP, \fBuint\fP, \fBQ\fP > glm::uaddCarry (\fBvec\fP< \fBL\fP, \fBuint\fP, \fBQ\fP > const & x, \fBvec\fP< \fBL\fP, \fBuint\fP, \fBQ\fP > const & y, \fBvec\fP< \fBL\fP, \fBuint\fP, \fBQ\fP > & carry)"
Adds 32-bit unsigned integer x and y, returning the sum modulo pow(2, 32)\&. The value carry is set to 0 if the sum was less than pow(2, 32), or to 1 otherwise\&.
.PP
\fBTemplate Parameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIL\fP An integer between 1 and 4 included that qualify the dimension of the vector\&.
.RE
.PP
