.SS "template<\fBlength_t\fP L, \fBqualifier\fP Q> \fBGLM_FUNC_DECL\fP \fBvec\fP< \fBL\fP, \fBuint\fP, \fBQ\fP > glm::usubBorrow (\fBvec\fP< \fBL\fP, \fBuint\fP, \fBQ\fP > const & x, \fBvec\fP< \fBL\fP, \fBuint\fP, \fBQ\fP > const & y, \fBvec\fP< \fBL\fP, \fBuint\fP, \fBQ\fP > & borrow)"
Subtracts the 32-bit unsigned integer y from x, returning the difference if non-negative, or pow(2, 32) plus the difference otherwise\&. The value borrow is set to 0 if x >= y, or to 1 otherwise\&.
